            <TextArea layoutX="13.0" layoutY="34.0" prefHeight="289.0" prefWidth="314.0" text="The Patient Charges section is used to assign dental &#10;services and their charges to a patient's appointment.&#10;&#10;How to Add Patient Charges&#10;Click Patient Charges from the menu.&#10;Select the required Appointment No.&#10;Select the appropriate Dental Service.&#10;Select or enter the related Dental Charge.&#10;Verify the selected service and amount.&#10;Click ADD to add the charge to the patient's &#10;appointment.&#10;&#10;The added service information will appear in the &#10;table.&#10;&#10;Repeat these steps when more than one dental &#10;service needs to be added to the same appointment.&#10;&#10;Make sure the correct appointment and dental &#10;service are selected before adding a charge." />
